      "Run a read-only inspector script that reports WP-CLI and WordPress site status.",
      "Plan safe search-replace workflows with backup, dry run, scope, and verification steps.",
      "Support plugin, theme, cron, cache, rewrite, and language package operations.",
      "Explain multisite targeting choices for single-site and network-wide tasks.",
      "Provide automation patterns for wp-cli.yml, shell scripts, and CI jobs."
